Third-party audio
-----------------

Portions of the notification audio are derived from Kenney UI Audio by Kenney:
https://kenney.nl/assets/ui-audio

Source files used: click1.ogg, click2.ogg, click3.ogg, rollover1.ogg,
rollover4.ogg, rollover6.ogg, switch1.ogg, switch7.ogg, switch10.ogg,
switch15.ogg, switch20.ogg, and switch31.ogg.

The source files are dedicated to the public domain under Creative Commons CC0
1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Nerve peak-normalizes and transcodes these files to mono MP3 for distribution.
